  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat frying pan over high heat with olive oil Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Transfer to a plate and cover to keep warm Zap rice in microwave until steaming, 2-3 mins",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3ee099108d7a02f00c632/step-48ce7b62.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Return pan to high heat with olive oil Drain sweetcorn Cook corn, tossing, until lightly charred, 3-4 mins Add spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/62c3ee099108d7a02f00c632/step-2194c797.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "To pan with the corn, add roasted veggies, rice and spinach, tossing to combine. Season to taste Plate up roast veggie rice. Top with haloumi, BBQ mayo and sour cream. Tear over coriander to serve",
